# aquery ids (wave 3, D): a depset converted to a NestedSet while the rule implementation runs
# (action inputs) and read again from the frozen provider by dependents is one NestedSet in Bazel
# (Depset.getSet), so ActionGraphDump's KnownNestedSets gives it one depSetOfFiles id: a's hdrs
# are the inputs of a's action and a transitive member of the inputs of b's and c's actions.
run aquery //... --output=jsonproto
run build //...
